  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Agua Potable y Saneamiento Pereira.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Potable Water and Sanitation Pereira</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM INCLUDES: (I) SUPPORT FOR THE ORGANIZATION AND OPERATION OF A NEW WATER AND SEWERAGE CO. RESULTING FROM THE RESTRUCTURING OF A MULTISERVICE COMPANY INTO SEPARATE AUTONOMOUS SERVICES; (II)INVESTMENTS IN SEWERAGE AND POTABLE WATER NETWORKS; AND (III) SUPPORT IN THE PREPARATION OF STUDIES AND BIDDING DOC. TO ENCOURAGE PRIVATE SECTOR PARTICIPATION IN THE CONSTRUCTION AND OPERATION OF A WASTEWATER TREATMENT PLANT THROUGH A BOT SCHEME.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
